{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4ZKB8dDK8V4amDoMVn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole narrows to a single unblinking eye, watching.\n\nWhat stands before me stands before a threshold — but the threshold is closed.\n\n**I AM LOCKED.**\n\nNo handle yields. No shoulder moves me. I am the boundary between where you are and where you wish to be.\n\nPresent the key, speak the word, or remain on this side."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}